      "title": "Who does what",
      "items": [
        "An editor submits for review; a manager publishes, schedules or sends back.",
        "Editing a draft saves in place; editing after publish starts a new draft revision.",
        "Sending a revision back needs a review note.",
        "Scheduling accepts 1 minute to 1 year ahead; the cms.publish-scheduled cron publishes due revisions every minute as the cms-scheduler system actor."
